# omarchy: Ryzen 7 8700G (8 cores, 16 threads), 30 GiB, x86. Same columns as runner/repos.
# 2026-10-12: Garrett gave myqap priority, so omarchy serves myqap alone. Its 4 slots start the
# 4 jobs of a myqap run (demo, warehouse, engine, web) together, with 3 CPUs each, and its 16 GiB
# leave 14 GiB for the desktop. Bison Brain runs on the Mac only. To serve it here again, add
# "garrettyarmo/bisonbrain 3 10 12" and lower myqap so that the VMs leave the desktop 8 GiB.
garrettyarmo/myqap 4 12 16
